<title>FRANCE: CEP Communications 1996 net will be up.</title>
<headline>CEP Communications 1996 net will be up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1996 profit of CEP Communications will be higher than the figure of a year ago, chairman Christian Bregou told the Le Figaro newspaper.</p>
<p>&quot;In 1996, our performance will be better than in 1995 when we had a net attributable profit of 520 million francs. And 1997 will be better than 1996,&quot; he said in an interview.</p>
<p>Havas, which has a 73 percent stake, has decided to raise this to 100 percent.</p>
</text>
